  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃も、自分用にか？\r\nせっかくだから、仕事の記念にとっておきたいよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい……。それもあるんですけれど\r\nこの前の撮影で、気になることがあったので……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか？\r\nいったい、どんなところが気になったんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと……私、みんなに比べて\r\nあんまり自然に笑えてない気がしていて……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だから、色んな写真を見て\r\n自分なりに勉強をしてみようと思ったんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n真乃がアイドルに対して勉強熱心で、嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "い、いえ……！　そんなっ\r\nプ、プロデューサーさんほどじゃありません",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは。じゃあ、ふたりとも同じくらい熱心なのかもな\r\n同じ本を買いに来るわけだしさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかも、同時に同じ本屋に来るなんて\r\n本当に偶然だよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふ、私もビックリしちゃいました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんともお会いできましたし\r\nこの本屋さんに来て正解でした",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、俺もだよ\r\n——あ、ここで立ち話してるのはお店に悪いよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふたりで同じ本を買うっていうのも変な感じがするけど……\r\nとりあえず、お会計を済ませるか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、そうですね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
