    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふぅ……ちゃんと買えて良かったです",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃は、この後どうするんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今日は１日お休みなので\r\nこの雑誌を見て勉強をしようって思います",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nならその雑誌、ゆっくり読めるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あのっ\r\nプロデューサーさんっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　どうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと……\r\nこの後、お時間ってありますか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、時間なら大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "本当ですかっ、それなら……あの……\r\n一緒に雑誌を見ながら、お話ししたいんです……っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "アイドルとしての自然な笑顔ってどんなのか、\r\nプロデューサーさんに聞いてみたくて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな、そういうことか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……で、でも\r\n忙しかったら大丈夫ですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、もちろん大丈夫だよ\r\n真乃の勉強になるなら、いくらでも話すぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわぁ……。ありがとうございますっ\r\nプロデューサーさんっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふっ、どんなアドバイスがもらえるのか\r\nとっても楽しみですっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100501/2001005010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……！　いい笑顔だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（本当は、必要以上に気にすることじゃないのになぁ\r\nだって真乃は、こんなに素敵に笑えるんだから）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（どうやって伝えるのが、\r\n真乃にとって１番わかりやすいだろうか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001005010270,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "行きましょう、プロデューサーさんっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
